WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:06.500
Sorry to drag you down here, man.

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:08.380
Son of a bitch.

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:10.340
There he is.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:13.140
I know it's been tough on both of you since Rose passed.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.520
You are so much smarter than this.

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:20.200
Christ knows you didn't get that from me.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:27.940
Everyone all right?

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.200
This is 87 westbound. Can you hear me?

00:00:32.965 --> 00:00:33.965
The hell was that?

00:00:37.415 --> 00:00:38.435
What the f-...

00:00:44.465 --> 00:00:45.465
There was a light.

00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:47.065
I can't explain it.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.000
It took everyone.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:55.740
Oh my God.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:03.700
We're under attack.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:12.120
Do exactly as I say.

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:13.240
Move.

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:15.500
Listen to me.

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:17.840
You help me find my son.

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:19.860
I'll help everyone

00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:22.620
 

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:25.120
We defend this town...

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:26.500
...or we die.

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:34.620
We do this together.

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:41.520
I have to find my son.

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:48.560
Hold on.

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:50.060
Now!

